&lt;/blockquote&gt;</summary><category scheme="https://io-oi.me/life/" term="life" label="life"/><category scheme="https://io-oi.me/tags/reading/" term="reading" label="reading"/><category scheme="https://io-oi.me/tags/movies/" term="movies" label="movies"/></entry><entry><title type="text">
算法認識的朋友</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://io-oi.me/life/adieu/"/><id>https://io-oi.me/life/adieu/</id><updated>2025-07-18T23:13:42+08:00</updated><published>2025-07-09T19:57:00+08:00</published><author><name>reuixiy</name><uri>https://io-oi.me/</uri><email>reuixiy@gmail.com</email></author><rights>在保留本文作者及本文連結的前提下，非商業用途隨意轉載分享。</rights><summary type="html">
&lt;p&gt;以前，在哪居住、走到哪、遇到甚麼人就與甚麼人成為朋友。有時，彼此離別前，背影還會留下一句「&lt;a href="https://reuixiy.notion.site/cb1428c595ae448f8ee28ef9cba02c76#081d0ec98cb94c648121ed6e59a25d92"&gt;我走了，有緣總會在一起的。&lt;/a&gt;」現在，在哪居住、走到哪、遇到甚麼人都匆匆而過——時間都給螢幕、网路。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;閱讀全文：&lt;a href="https://io-oi.me/life/adieu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://io-oi.me/life/adieu/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
