&lt;/blockquote&gt;</summary><category scheme="https://io-oi.me/life/" term="life" label="life"/><category scheme="https://io-oi.me/tags/taylor-swift/" term="taylor-swift" label="taylor-swift"/></entry><entry><title type="text">
